<tr><td>Associated diseases</td><td>Diabetes mellitus；renal failure；hepatic insufficiency；congestive cardiac failure</td><td>None（acquired variant：renal failure）</td><td>Down syndrome；Ehlers-Danlos syndrome；osteogenesis imperfecta；pseudoxanthoma elasticum</td><td>None</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mode of inheritance</td><td>—</td><td>? autosomal recessive；? autosomal dominant</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Histology</td><td>Transepidermal elimination of degenerate parakeratin and inflammatory debris</td><td>Transepidermal elimination of collagen</td><td>Transepidermal elimination of abnormal elastic tissue</td><td>Intrafollicular curled-up hair；transepidermal elimination of degenerate connective tissue</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">McKee Table 9.3，McKee p.343。Sex distribution 依原表寫法；內文為 EPS male predominance 4 : 1（McKee p.344）、PF female predominance 2 : 1（McKee p.342）。McKee 內文另寫 perforating folliculitis 與 renal failure、diabetes mellitus 相關（McKee p.342）。</p>
<h3>McKee 臨床補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>Reactive perforating collagenosis：輕微外傷（scratch、insect bite）後出現 <strong class="ex-n">1–2 mm</strong> papules，約 <strong class="ex-n">4 weeks</strong> 長到 <strong class="ex-n">5–10 mm</strong> 並 umbilicate，<strong class="ex-n">6–8 weeks</strong> 時只剩疤或色素減退；深的穿刺傷正常癒合；positive Koebner phenomenon 是特徵；天冷時嚴重度似乎增加、夏天病灶數減少。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.341</span></li>
<li>Acquired variant 主要與 DM、renal failure 相關；perforating collagenosis 見於約 <strong class="ex-n">10%</strong> 的 renal failure 病人，多數同時有 DM；藥物 sirolimus、indinavir、erlotinib 也曾相關。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.341</span></li>
<li>Perforating folliculitis 相關藥物：sorafenib、infliximab、etanercept、lenalidomide、nilotinib。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.342</span></li>
<li>EPS：<strong class="ex-n">2–5 mm</strong> keratotic papule，plug 剝除會出血；最常侵犯 back and sides of neck；通常無症狀。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.344</span></li>
<li>Kyrle disease：very rare；<strong class="ex-n">1–8 mm</strong> papules，中央 cone-shaped keratotic plug；mucous membranes、palms、soles 特徵性不受侵犯；有時與 DM、renal failure、hepatic insufficiency、congestive cardiac failure 相關。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.346</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="laboratory">
<h2>6. Laboratory Tests（檢驗）</h2>
<ul>
<li>評估共病：fasting blood glucose、glucose tolerance test、serum creatinine、GFR 或 creatinine clearance、serum uric acid、liver function tests、thyroid function tests。<span class="ex-ref">p.1207</span></li>
<li>詳細詢問家族史、過去病史與 review of systems；依需要針對相關疾病（Table 71-4）加做檢查。<span class="ex-ref">p.1207</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ddx">
<h2>7. Differential Diagnosis（鑑別診斷）</h2>
<ul>
<li>APD 鑑別診斷很廣，包括感染、發炎、腫瘤性疾病，包括會 koebnerize 的疾病。<span class="ex-ref">p.1207</span></li>
<li>APD 與 <strong>prurigo nodularis</strong> <strong>可能</strong>特別難區分；<strong>perforating pseudoxanthoma elasticum</strong> 需與 AEPS 區分。<span class="ex-ref">p.1208</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Differential diagnosis of APD（Table 71-5）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Actinic granuloma（annular elastolytic giant cell granuloma）；arthropod bites；discoid lupus erythematosus；Flegel disease（hyperkeratosis follicularis perstans）；folliculitis（bacterial、yeast）；keratosis follicularis（Darier disease）；keratosis pilaris；lichen planus；multiple keratoacanthomas（Ferguson-Smith familial keratoacanthomas、Grzybowski eruptive keratoacanthomas）；perforating granuloma annulare；perforating periumbilical calcific elastosis；perforating pseudoxanthoma elasticum；porokeratosis；prurigo nodularis；psoriasis；sarcoidosis；scabies</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 71-5，p.1208。</p>
<h3>McKee 補充</h3>
<ul>
<li>Reactive perforating collagenosis 樣變化也可見於「正常人」外傷後；prurigo nodularis／lichen simplex chronicus 的切片不少見 collagen 的 transepidermal elimination。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.342</span></li>
<li>Perforating folliculitis vs Kyrle disease：前者為一致的毛囊侵犯、infundibular epithelium 穿孔（Kyrle disease 穿孔在病灶底部），並有 tortuous hairs；PF 毛囊內的 elastic fibers 外觀不異常、數量也不增加（不同於 EPS）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.344</span></li>
<li>Keratosis pilaris 有 folliculocentric keratotic plugs，但沒有穿孔與發炎。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.344</span></li>
<li>Perforating pseudoxanthoma elasticum 主要見於多產、肥胖、中年、常有高血壓的黑人女性，表現為單獨的 abdominal、periumbilical 侵犯；可能與 renal failure 相關。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.348</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="course">
<h2>8. Complications &amp; Prognosis（併發症與預後）</h2>
<ul>
<li>多數併發症來自潛在的系統性疾病；但需監測 secondary infection（bacterial、fungal、viral）與 parasitic infestation。<span class="ex-ref">p.1208</span></li>
<li>病人為止癢塗抹的產品<strong>可能</strong>造成 irritant 或 allergic contact dermatitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1208</span></li>
<li>深膚色、抓痕較多的病人，postinflammatory pigmentary alteration 與 scarring 可能很明顯。<span class="ex-ref">p.1208</span></li>
<li>預後與潛在疾病高度相關；有些研究顯示成功治療潛在疾病後 APD <strong>可能</strong>改善；<strong>多數 APD 若未治療會持續數年</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1208</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="treatment">
<h2>9. Treatment（治療）</h2>
<ul>
<li>APD 治療困難，沒有一體適用的有效療法，病人常呈 chronic course。<span class="ex-ref">p.1203</span></li>
<li>沒有設計良好的臨床試驗，目前治療策略大多基於 anecdotal reports。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
<li>CKD 病人：更換 dialysis tubing 種類或調整 dialysis procedure 後曾有改善報告；少數病例在 <strong>renal transplantation</strong> 後消退。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="109-28">最常用的治療：topical 與 oral <strong>retinoids</strong>、topical 與 intradermal <strong>corticosteroids</strong>、<strong>ultraviolet B phototherapy</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="109-28">Phototherapy 對 uremic pruritus 有效，因此可能藉由減少 koebnerization 而特別有益於 CKD 病人</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
<li>數位作者報告 <strong>allopurinol</strong> 治療後 APD 改善，包括 uric acid 升高或正常的病例。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
<li>現有療法<strong>可能</strong>無法讓病灶或症狀完全消失。<span class="ex-ref">p.1209</span></li>
</ul>
